00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:13.946
&gt;&gt; Jesse: IT'S TIME FOR

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:15.814
"ONE MORE THING."

00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:17.182
SOME PEOPLE ASKED ME ON TWITTER,

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.583
WHAT'S THAT THING AROUND YOUR

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.184
WRIST.

00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:20.786
IT'S A BRACELET I HAVE.

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:21.153
IT SAYS "EVERY DAY IS A

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.190
VICTORY."

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:26.425
ON THE OTHER SIDE, FULL-COURT

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.126
PRESS ON ALS.

00:00:26.558 --> 00:00:30.296
LOU GEHRIG'S DISEASE.

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:32.398
I HAVE A SPECIAL GUEST HERE, MY

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:33.766
MAN MICHAEL HERE IN STUDIO WHO

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:35.200
CAME UP TO VISIT AND WATCH THE

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:37.002
SHOW TODAY.

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:39.605
HE IS BEHIND THE ORGANIZATION

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:41.040
THAT RAISES AWARENESS FOR ALS.

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:42.608
ALSO RAISES MONEY FOR FUNDING

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:45.177
FOR MEDICAL RESEARCH AS WELL.

00:00:42.741 --> 00:00:47.413
I WANT TO GIVE A SPECIAL SHOUT

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.846
OUT TO MY MAN MIKE IN STUDIO

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.748
TODAY.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:52.384
GREG GUTFELD.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:53.218
&gt;&gt; Greg: HE IS KIND OF A

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:56.422
BIGGER FAN OF ME.

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:56.689
&gt;&gt; Jesse: MORE OF A "REDEYE"

